930/extras/7bb059ad23765133903ba3e1b3ec45aa.mp4?t=1751142212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gameplay</i></strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**<u>Checkpoint Saves</u>**</strong>: Seamlessly pick up where you left off with checkpoint saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong></u>**: Dive into a meticulously crafted, eerie house, where every corner holds secrets waiting to be uncovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Compelling Mystery</strong></u>**: Piece together the events of a tragic night by gathering clues scattered throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Terrifying Atmosphere</strong></u>**: Experience spine-chilling moments as you navigate through an environment filled with unexplainable phenomena and unsettling sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Interactive Horror</strong></u>**: Engage with the environment and trigger paranormal events, blurring the lines between reality and the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong></u>**: Test your wits with challenging puzzles that require keen observation to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Psychological Tension</strong></u>**: Encounter psychological horror elements that will keep you on the edge of your seat, questioning your own sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Rich Narrative</strong></u>**: Unravel a captivating storyline through environmental storytelling and discovered documents, immersing yourself in the haunting narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Replayability</strong></u>**: Explore branching pathways and discover different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<u><strong>Unforgettable Horror</strong></u>**: Brace yourself for an unforgettable horror experience, filled with suspense, dread, and moments that will stay with you long after the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852930/extras/adc8a56998456ad8c76cb9fe4dbfeebf.poster.avif?t=1751142212\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852930/extras/adc8a56998456ad8c76cb9fe4dbfeebf.webm?t=1751142212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852930/extras/adc8a56998456ad8c76cb9fe4dbfeebf.mp4?t=1751142212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
